<div class="daily-supplies-dialog">
  {{#if dailyLiving}}
  <p>Settle each character's saved daily choice. Lifestyle payments replace food and water; other checked supplies still apply. Insufficient funds remain unresolved.</p>
  <ul>{{#each livingRows}}<li><strong>{{name}}</strong>: {{label}} · {{cost}} gp for this use{{#if reason}} · {{reason}}{{/if}}</li>{{/each}}</ul>
  {{/if}}
  {{#if rollover}}<p>The day has ended. Use supplies for the {{days}} completed day(s) before continuing?</p>
  {{else}}<p>Consume one day of supplies for the party?</p>{{/if}}
  <p>{{consumerCount}} consuming character(s). Each checked row shows the total for {{days}} day(s), including the current half-ration rule. Available units include prepaid portions left from earlier uses.</p>
  <fieldset>
    <legend>Choose supplies for this use</legend>
    {{#each resources}}
      <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin: 0.5rem 0;">
        <input type="checkbox" name="dailyResource" value="{{id}}" checked {{#if mandatory}}disabled{{/if}} />
        <span>{{label}} — {{required}} required · {{available}} available{{#if shortfall}} · {{shortfall}} short{{/if}}<br><small>Base rate: {{perDay}} per day {{#if isParty}}for the party{{else}}per character{{/if}}. {{#if mandatory}}Required for characters using supplies.{{else}}Uncheck to skip this supply.{{/if}}</small></span>
      </label>
    {{/each}}
  </fieldset>
  {{#unless hasResources}}<p>No daily supplies are enabled. Configure them in Quartermaster → Setup &amp; Rules.</p>{{/unless}}
  {{#unless dailyLiving}}<p>Only checked supplies are consumed, without foraging or changing the world clock. Unchecked supplies cause no shortages or exhaustion. Half-ration rules still apply.</p>{{/unless}}
</div>
